{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprite's City Scramble is a 3D exploration-based puzzle platformer revolving around Sprite, an alien parasite who has come to our world to learn more about its inhabitants. As Sprite, you can take over different creatures that each have unique abilities which assist in exploring your environment, solving interactive puzzles and collecting \u201cartifacts\u201d which are random everyday items that, to Sprite, are invaluable sources of knowledge. Use all resources available to progress through various challenges so you can eventually return home with your newfound understanding of this strange and interesting planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game-jam game made by:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ewan Burkinshaw</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Henry Bunn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joshua Mahil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killian Khada</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max Senior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ricco Vergara</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robin Crews</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027490?t=1759327214","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027490?t=1759327214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027490/8ea816ac1a3386b9aed00c31fb0b2581e1fd812f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759327214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027490/8ea816ac1a3386b9aed00c31fb0b2581e1fd812f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759327214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprite's City Scramble is a 3D exploration-based puzzle platformer revolving around Sprite, an alien parasite who has come to our world to learn more about its inhabitants. As Sprite, you can t